        "id": "DravenPassive",
        "name": "League of Draven",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Draven gains his fans' Adoration when he catches a Spinning Axe or kills a minion, monster, or tower. Killing enemy champions grants Draven bonus gold based on how much Adoration he has.",
        "bodyHtml": "Draven gains 1 stack whenever he kills a non-champion unit or turret, catches a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spinning Axe</span>.<br /><br />Draven gains 25 gold plus 2 additional gold per stack upon killing a champion. Draven loses 50% of stacks upon death.<br /><br />Total Gold Earned: <span>1</span><br />Highest Reward: <span>1</span>",
