        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Draven gains increased Move Speed and Attack Speed. The Move Speed bonus decreases rapidly over its duration. Catching a Spinning Axe will refresh the cooldown of Blood Rush.",
        "bodyHtml": "Draven becomes Ghosted, gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">50/55/60/65/70% Move Speed</span> decaying over 1.5 seconds and <span>20/25/30/35/40% Attack Speed</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br />When Draven catches a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spinning Axe</span>, this Ability's Cooldown is refreshed.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Ghosted units can pass through other units.</span>",
