      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "DravenRCast",
        "name": "Whirling Death",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Draven hurls two massive axes to deal physical damage to each unit struck. Whirling Death slowly reverses direction and returns to Draven after striking an enemy champion. Draven may also activate this ability while the axes are in flight to cause it to return early. Deals less damage for each unit hit and resets when the axes reverse direction. Executes enemies who have less health than Draven's number of Adoration stacks.",
        "bodyHtml": "Draven hurls two massive axes that deal <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(200/300/400 + (110/130/150% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. Upon hitting a champion or <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recasting</span>, they reverse direction and return to Draven. The axes deal 5% less damage for each enemy hit, down to a minimum of 50%.<br /><br />If <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Whirling Death</span> would leave an enemy champion with less health than 100% of Draven's current <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">League of Draven</span> stacks (1), he will execute them.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Damage falloff resets after reversing direction.<br />Whirling Executes from League of Draven: ?</span>",
